{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🌸\n今日は、頂いた祝花を乗せていくよ〜\n1部から4部で着たお洋服順に載せていくね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部  黒コーデ(美愉のおさがり)2部 白コーデ3部 ローソン店員4部 ローソン店員\nの順でいくね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しほなーこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMXX10K2VHCC8K7FP4285T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">今度、2人で豆しばカフェに行くよ🐶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、りぼんポーズで!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMXY12CN1KYMWG9HBGY3MW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nお馴染みになってきたポーズです🎀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらーん(￣+ー￣)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMXZ25YPKR3K2W02MHWN83","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">可愛いイラスト、ありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白コーデに白いお花。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY04AGMT3989DG4W76EHN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n中のハートがお気に入りだったよ!♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな桃🍑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY18YJQAXKTJGXJZPE5E9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">カムサハムニダ〜!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンケーキ持ってるイラスト🥞(*´﹃`*)ｳﾏ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY2CPQ30XYZVFDHZ8TDHS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n髪を心配してくれてありがとう!今日も染めちゃった!笑🙇‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仏の顔も3度まで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY3EWTMK5G3XPKQVYR69E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nリアルでびっくり!本物かと思った･･･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと遅れたハロウィン🎃"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY4GQ547749ZHFASCKJ9C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nカルディのお菓子ってイメージ? 豪華だなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念力送ってる風👐"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY5HM2EF8XJ3H4Q2YVKRJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ダニはパンケーキ並んでました。関係ないですが、写真集のダニに惚れました。\n \nお花、ありがとうございました!思い、たくさん伝わってます😌\n次の握手会まで、待っててね〜＼(　´ω`　)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう言えば、ぺーと横浜中華街に行ったよ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY6GAKE9MNBARGTXGRFNK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n焼き小龍包と春巻きもあったよ!\nとっても最高でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMY7GPEDYNX6308F5YXGAG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}